nding · Grey: belongs to another area · IDs point to the decision or question in &lt;code&gt;architecture.md&lt;/code&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#334155;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="820" width="1300" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>